Package: fbterm
Architecture: i386
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig-config
Description: framebuffer terminal with Unicode, emoji and native Poulsback scrolling
 FbTerm uses fontconfig and FreeType to render a Linux console terminal.
 This fork includes Unicode, color emoji and screen blanking
 changes and offers an explicitly selected Poulsback DRM/2D backend.
 An isolated runtime under /opt/fbterm supports older i386 installations
 without replacing their system libraries. The executable is /usr/bin/fbterm.
